BottleShip LAN Rust gateway

Native UDP/TCP gateway adapters for the bottleship-lan relay. They carry the
virtual LAN datagram layout of bottleship-lan-core, which is based on
https://github.com/cszackrison/bottleship
(src/worker/net/lan-network.ts and src/worker/net/netplay-wire.ts),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Copyright BottleShip contributors and cszackrison/bottleship contributors.

The gateway itself is a new implementation.
